raph\" >Search every corner of the environment and you can find valuable items! Anything can help you survive and make you more powerful in facing your enemies. Cheese what to carry wisely and manage your resources to master your survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/9f5ff05d6685194341b810e27465d347.webp?t=1784571716\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming through the dark ruins of EC-21 JANUS, Solving puzzles, and escaping the most fatal events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/ca221d6f6dcd97afcac7374b1270487a.poster.avif?t=1784571716\" width=620 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/ca221d6f6dcd97afcac7374b1270487a.webm?t=1784571716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/ca221d6f6dcd97afcac7374b1270487a.mp4?t=1784571716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and begin your horror adventure in the massive open world of the EC-21 JANUS colony, Solve puzzles and platforms to discover new evidence. myths to uncover the horror history of humanity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/640761528abfd51f4de62098243da080.webp?t=1784571716\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay altered as danger lies in every corner of the colony, you are alone yet are never alone! it is possible that every enemy you see makes theirs to you! Be ready and you are never safe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/bc80aab3a934df0dc0f54087c07448c3.poster.avif?t=1784571716\" width=620 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/bc80aab3a934df0dc0f54087c07448c3.webm?t=1784571716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/bc80aab3a934df0dc0f54087c07448c3.mp4?t=1784571716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be vigilant, Be Ware, and never rest easy that there are enemies in every corner of this world that want to rip you apart and make you one of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVELOPER&quot;s ROADMAP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to thank you for joining us! We are now in the Pre-alpha stage of the game. we have tons of ideas and we are taking our time executing each of them perfectly! We'll be updating this section and keeping you guys posted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/46424a33de51732bf953cc8bba35160d.poster.avif?t=1784571716\" width=620 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/46424a33de51732bf953cc8bba35160d.webm?t=1784571716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/46424a33de51732bf953cc8bba35160d.mp4?t=1784571716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WE ARE SMASHING IT! WE WORK HARD TO MAKE IT FUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/extras/8adff041834ae36da3a4d0397e3fbbe8.avif?t=1784571716\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Sci-fi Horror now comes to Metroidvania, Creating The Horrovania, Begin your most disturbing adventure to the colony of EC-21 JANUS, KILL, LOOT, AND SURVIVE, and Immerse yourself in the huge open-world hand-drawn environments with massive details.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/0257ae9f002885b0dd96772747ccc838e71700d2/header.jpg?t=1784571716", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/f2e62236b4a66a37aa6fa6172f6f38693badbe3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784571716", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381860/f2e62236b4a66a37aa6fa6172f6f38693badbe3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784571716", "website": "https://www.theredselene.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stron